  "port_adjustments": [
    "Minimal package __init__ defines the source version without distribution metadata lookup or application startup",
    "service/storage.py default_path uses TEAM_EDUCATION_DB or this project instance/education.sqlite3",
    "FastAPI app and transport modules were deliberately excluded; the Flask adapter owns transport",
    "No personal database, runtime token, teacher secret, or AGENTS.md was copied",
    "service/storage.py closes backup and read-only restore connections explicitly to release Windows file locks",
    "api/__init__.py describes the transport-independent schemas rather than a FastAPI server",
    "service/storage.py validates existing archive table shapes before writes so legacy account-model databases are rejected unchanged",
    "service/backup.py refuses the SQLite backup command in PostgreSQL deployments to avoid a misleading empty backup",
    "service/classroom.py adds ordinary-member team controls, exclusive self claims and teacher-independent connection lifecycle while preserving legacy teacher mode",
    "service/autosave.py restores team participants without requiring a teacher during failed-write rollback",
    "service/storage.py respects an outer SQLite transaction so stable-link membership and checkpoint save atomically"
  ]
